{"id":"vod_bf_28407","vodId":"28407","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"Rewrite第一季","name_cn":"Rewrite第一季","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-29/e6be1b6d09cd5dc617a499b93e130f43.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在名为“风祭”的都市之中，天王寺瑚太朗（森田成一 配音）是一名平凡的高中生，过着风平浪静的生活。一年一度的收获祭即将到来，这个热闹欢快的祭典让整个城市都陷入了欢乐而躁动的海洋之中。　　瑚太郎接受了一份寻找新闻线索的工作，于是开始了在城市各处的奔走，在此过程中，只存在于都市传说之中的怪奇事件和神秘生物渐渐浮出了水面，与此同时，瑚太郎的身边亦发生了许多令他百思不得其解的怪事。为此，瑚太郎找到了超自然研究会的会长千里朱音（喜多村英梨 配音），希望后者能够解答他的疑惑，哪知道在两人调查的过程中，瑚太郎的一干好友纷纷被卷入了风暴之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 05:51:15","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/Rewritediyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/Rewritediyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/Rewritediyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/Rewritediyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/Rewritediyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/Rewritediyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/Rewritediyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/Rewritediyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/Rewritediyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/Rewritediyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/Rewritediyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/Rewritediyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/Rewritediyiji/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32:56.490Z"}